Every AI API works the same way: send a request, get a response. The details change, the pattern doesn't.

Problem....>>>
Starting from Phase 11,you'll call LLM APIs (Anthropic, OpenAI, Google).
In Phase 13-16 you'll build agents that use these APIs in loops.
You need to know how API keys work, how to store them safely, and how to make your first API call.


